// Copy to Local.xcconfig and set DEVELOPMENT_TEAM to your Apple Development team.
// Local.xcconfig is gitignored. Empty team = unsigned build (what CI does).
// WARNING: CI artifacts (goat_web.wasm, embed.html) carry no code signature; verify
// checksums before promoting a CI build to distribution.
// For distribution set PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER to a named profile; Automatic
// signing may silently select a distribution certificate with unreviewed entitlements.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Manual
